ALVA — Completely Remove Lore from Discover

Objective

Work in the GitHub repository hiyroscript/alva, on the latest main branch.

Completely remove the Lore feature from Discover, including its tab, page, data source, translations, dedicated styling, tests, and references in documentation describing the current application.

The final Discover interface must contain exactly three sections, in this order:

1. Fighters
2. Movement
3. Launch

This is a complete feature removal, not simply hiding a tab.

Do not replace Lore with another feature, placeholder, empty page, or “Coming soon” message.

Preserve all remaining functionality, presentation quality, accessibility, localization, and gameplay behavior.

